@savage_labour
title: Savage Labour in the Commons
subtitle: Labour's leader is wounded; the right cheers.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next action.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; lab_leader_rating -= 3; right_dissent -= 4; wet_dissent += 2

Tebbit's insults are the best-reported speech of the week.

@tebbit_act
title: Fast-track a new Employment Bill
view-if: con_in_government = 1 and bill_employment2 = 0 and (bill_employment1 = 0 or bill_employment1 = 6) and time >= bill_employment2_wait
subtitle: Strips the unions of their immunities. A month in committee, a month in the Lords.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and bill_room = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next Cabinet action. ?][? if advisor_action_timer = 0 : [+ bill_room_text +] ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; wet_dissent += 4; dry_dissent -= 3; bill_new = "employment2"; bill_new_fast = 1
call: bill_introduce

Tebbit drafts much of the bill himself. It narrows the definition of a lawful trade dispute, exposes union funds to damages, and outlaws the closed shop unless a large majority of workers vote for it. The whips find time for it at the front of the queue.

@on_your_bike
title: "On your bike"
subtitle: A conference speech on unemployment.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next Cabinet action.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; right_dissent -= 5; dry_dissent -= 3; wet_dissent += 3; c2_con += 1*(1-dissent) if unemployment < 10; c2_con -= 1 if unemployment >= 10
achievement: on_your_bike

Tebbit tells the conference that his unemployed father didn't riot in the 1930s: "He got on his bike and looked for work." [? if unemployment >= 10 : With unemployment at [+ unemployment_2 +]%, many people take it as an insult. ?]
